  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The property would be not suitable for conversion to a House in Multiple Occupation as the original floor space would be less than 130 square metres and would result in the loss of a small single family dwellinghouse, and would not be located within an area with good access to public transportation and convenient walking distance of town centre facilities. The proposal is therefore unacceptable in principle, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG.\r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, due to a lack of information to demonstrate otherwise, would intensify the use of the site and would fail to be appropriately managed to not result in increased noise and disturbance to residents of neighbouring properties, contrary to Local Plan policy SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPG.\r\n",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal, due to a lack of information to demonstrate otherwise, would fail to provide a sufficient standard of accommodation for future occupiers by virtue of the cramped and inadequate internal ceiling height. The proposal is therefore contrary to Local Plan policies SC5 and SC10 and the Houses in Multiple Occupation SPD.\r\n",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposed development would fail to provide adequate access to vehicle and cycle parking facilities for occupiers, failing to sufficiently promote sustainable modes of transport, and would therefore fail to comply with Local Plan policy EC2 and London Plan policy T5. "
  ],
